║ SPL Detection #03: Suspicious PowerShell Activity                            ║
║ Author: Maher Mansour Mahyoub Ghaleb                                          ║
║ MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 - PowerShell | T1027 - Obfuscated Files             ║
║ Severity: HIGH | Confidence: MEDIUM-HIGH                                      ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

## Detection Description
Identifies suspicious PowerShell execution patterns commonly used by adversaries
for initial execution, defense evasion, and payload delivery. Focuses on:
- Encoded command execution
- Hidden window execution
- Download cradles (DownloadString, DownloadFile)
- Reflection-based loading
- Suspicious parent-child relationships

## Query Logic
- Monitors PowerShell process creation events
- Matches multiple obfuscation/evasion patterns
- Correlates with parent processes (cmd, wscript, cscript)
- Dynamic severity based on pattern complexity

## SPL Query (Production-Ready)

```spl
index=windows (Image="*\\powershell.exe" OR Image="*\\pwsh.exe") earliest=-15m latest=now
| fillnull value="" CommandLine
| eval suspicious_pattern = case(
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[eE]nc(odedCommand)?\\s"), "EncodedCommand",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[wW]indowStyle\\s+[Hh]idden"), "HiddenWindow",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[nN]o[nP]rofile"), "NoProfile",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[eE]xecutionPolicy\\s+[Bb]ypass"), "ExecutionPolicyBypass",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)(DownloadString|DownloadFile|IEX|Invoke-Expression)"), "DownloadCradle",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)System\\.Reflection\\.Assembly"), "ReflectionLoad",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)FromBase64String|ToBase64String"), "Base64Encoding",
    match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[eE]n[vV]\\s"), "EnvironmentVariable",
    1=1, "None"
  )
| eval risk_score = 0
| eval risk_score = if(match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[eE]nc(odedCommand)?"), risk_score + 30, risk_score)
| eval risk_score = if(match(CommandLine, "(?i)(DownloadString|DownloadFile|IEX)"), risk_score + 25, risk_score)
| eval risk_score = if(match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[wW]indowStyle\\s+[Hh]idden"), risk_score + 15, risk_score)
| eval risk_score = if(match(CommandLine, "(?i)-[eE]xecutionPolicy\\s+[Bb]ypass"), risk_score + 20, risk_score)
| eval risk_score = if(match(CommandLine, "(?i)System\\.Reflection\\.Assembly"), risk_score + 20, risk_score)
| eval risk_score = if(match(ParentImage, "(?i)(cmd|wscript|cscript|mshta|regsvr32|rundll32)"), risk_score + 25, risk_score)
| where suspicious_pattern != "None" AND risk_score >= 30
| eval severity = case(
    risk_score >= 70, "CRITICAL",
    risk_score >= 50, "HIGH",
    risk_score >= 30, "MEDIUM",
    1=1, "LOW"
  )
| rex field=CommandLine "(?<base64_content>[A-Za-z0-9+/=]{100,})"
| eval has_base64 = if(isnotnull(base64_content), "YES", "NO")
| eval alert_summary = "PowerShell on " . Computer . " by " . User . " with risk score " . risk_score . " - " . suspicious_pattern
| sort - risk_score
| table _time, Computer, User, ParentImage, CommandLine, suspicious_pattern, risk_score, severity, has_base64, alert_summary
| rename _time as detection_time
```

## Recommended Alert Configuration
- **Trigger Condition:** risk_score >= 50 (HIGH/CRITICAL)
- **Throttle:** 1 hour per user-host combination
- **Action:** TheHive case creation + SOC analyst review
- **Severity Mapping:** MEDIUM -> Yellow, HIGH -> Orange, CRITICAL -> Red

## Investigation Steps
1. Decode the base64 content if present (use CyberChef or similar)
2. Review the parent process - was it Office, browser, or another suspicious source?
3. Examine the full command line for indicators of compromise
4. Check for file artifacts in user temp directories
5. Review network connections from the host during execution
6. Look for child processes spawned by this PowerShell instance
7. Search for similar patterns across the environment (same content)

## False Positive Sources
- SCCM client health checks
- Software deployment scripts
- DevOps automation tools
- Some RMM (Remote Monitoring and Management) tools

## Related Sigma Rule
